git-resource.ts extracts Status, Resource.getStatusLetter/getStatusText/getStatusColor
and Repository.parseIgnoreCheck. VS Code API types, ThemeColor wrappers and l10n
wrappers are removed; the switch bodies and ignore parser are otherwise retained.
git-colors.json extracts contributes.colors defaults for gitDecoration.*.
../git-file-decorations.ts adapts repository XY status grouping, provider overwrite
order, rename aliases and resourceDecoration.propagate to Setdown's NUL porcelain-v2
snapshot. The SCM list uses
its own index/working-tree resource instead of the Explorer winner. Explorer presentation adapts workbench descendant propagation and badges
without the VS Code extension host, URI tree, dynamic CSS service or SCM commands.
Equal-weight descendant decorations use path order, not Resource.priority (which
VS Code does not pass to its FileDecoration API).

